Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.61,0:00:03.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu di sana!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.10,0:00:05.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, serahkan padaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Great Heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.74,0:00:10.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anak naga?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.49,0:00:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skill unik, Pengguncang Dunia!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.37,0:00:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya naga apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pak Kades, tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebentar lagi seharusnya dia siuman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan dia yang kumaksud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.13,0:00:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pak Kades, tidak apa-apa, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.50,0:00:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.51,0:00:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, sepertinya aku ingin\Nmakan makanan enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.22,0:00:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanti kuminta Masamune membuatkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, tolong bawa dia ke desa, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.82,0:00:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu kau di sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.78,0:00:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keluarlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.39,0:00:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa kau?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa tujuanmu kemari?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah insiden Echigoya,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.29,0:01:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku harus sedikit lebih tegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kau diam,\Nakan kupaksa kau membuka mulut.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:08.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penggandaan Air.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.51,0:01:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hukum Alam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.03,0:01:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa dan apa tujuanmu kemari?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.39,0:01:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pangeran Albert memerintahkanku
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.71,0:01:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mencari Naga Langit Hitam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.98,0:01:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pangeran itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa maunya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.61,0:01:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu Naga Langit Hitam?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.85,0:01:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk apa Pangeran mengincar naga itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.32,0:01:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.82,0:01:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kuduga, Albert pasti merahasiakannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.71,0:01:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang pergilah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.49,0:01:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, lupakan bahwa kita pernah bertemu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pangeran itu mengincar naga, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.88,0:01:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Naga apa ini?\N- Masih kecil, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:52.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa yang membawanya ke sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.93,0:01:54.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, Pak Kades.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.39,0:01:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, semuanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.35,0:01:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika Albert mengincarnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.50,0:02:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}artinya dia bukan naga biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika tak hati-hati, ini bisa memicu konflik.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:06.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tak apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.21,0:02:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lelahnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.91,0:02:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pak Kades, aku bahagia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, terima kasih, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.53,0:02:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku duluan...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Heal lagi, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.49,0:02:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini sudah yang ke berapa, ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.92,0:02:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia memakan skill?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.01,0:02:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}So What's Wrong with\NGetting Reborn as a Goblin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:09.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enak sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.73,0:04:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Dia makan apa?\N- Kenapa bisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa tidak berbahaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Barusan kau memberiku makan, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:21.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, rasanya enak sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.02,0:04:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bicaranya lancar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau memakan skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.50,0:04:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Supaya tidak kelaparan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.75,0:04:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan itu maksudku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa memakan skill baginya\Nsama dengan makan biasa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kulitnya halus sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lucu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.93,0:04:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin dia tidak jahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.85,0:04:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akira!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.61,0:04:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pulang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Chloe, ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku dapat banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bawa telur ayam untuk\Nbahan Masamune-yaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:04:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, hebat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masamune-yaki itu masakan\Nciptaan Masamune sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya itu sukiyaki\Nversi dari dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.67,0:05:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masamune membuat resepnya dari awal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, aku menyarankan agar dicocol\Nke telur kocok supaya lebih enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, langsung suruh dia\Nmembuat Masamune-yaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.51,0:05:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, Masamune-nya mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.51,0:05:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Si Penguasa Langit Hitam...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.01,0:05:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa dia di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.42,0:05:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tanduk itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.50,0:05:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau ada hubungan dengan Bang Iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bang Iblis?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.44,0:05:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudmu Raja Iblis?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan, tapi Adipati Iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari namanya, dia pasti iblis yang kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.24,0:05:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau kenal dia, Chloe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.53,0:05:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia Penguasa Langit Hitam,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naga Langit Hitam, Izyz!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naga Langit Hitam...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naga yang diincar Pangeran Albert,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.16,0:05:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pemilik skill unik, Pengguncang Dunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dilihat dari mana pun,\Ndia bukan makhluk sembarangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:05:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitulah pikirku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:00.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa tujuanmu kemari?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.69,0:06:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku lapar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.63,0:06:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bercanda!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.52,0:06:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak bercanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:18.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penggandaan Bayangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terbang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Api Hitam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:22.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hentikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.53,0:06:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya jadi ketakutan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.47,0:06:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aduh, maaf, ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah, sekarang aman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.33,0:06:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bertengkar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami kaget.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata kau bisa menjadi besar, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami sampai takut.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:43.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seandainya kami bertarung...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.43,0:06:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau hebat, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.10,0:06:51.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin kau Goblin terkuat\Nyang pernah kutemui.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.01,0:06:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.64,0:06:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin lebih kuat daripada yang satunya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.65,0:06:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:07:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena barusan makan, aku jadi lapar lagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal biasanya aku tahan\Ntidak makan selama seratus tahun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.61,0:07:08.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, sekali makan, perutku jadi lapar lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.37,0:07:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makan kadang memang membuat kita jadi lapar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.12,0:07:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, makanlah i...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enyak! Baik sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sama-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.13,0:07:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, kau mau jadi Raja Iblis?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, tidak dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.39,0:07:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau bilang begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ini sebenarnya naga penting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.48,0:07:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepenting apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku salah satu dari tiga orang\Nyang berhak menentukan Raja Iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sangat penting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang dikatakannya benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.65,0:07:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, biasanya kalau ada yang mengusulkan,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}langsung diputuskan dengan\N"ya sudah, boleh."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena tidak ada yang peduli\Nkalau bukan usulan mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, kenapa ditawarkan padaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, kamu bilang apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena skill-mu banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kudengar ada Goblin yang umurnya panjang,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.72,0:08:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi kupikir aku bisa minta makanan padanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:11.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena itu, aku datang ke sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, itu tujuannya, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.43,0:08:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku tak mau jadi Raja Iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.77,0:08:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya. Sayang sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Izyz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:23.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lembut sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Langsung lupa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.69,0:08:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku takkan jadi Raja Iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.41,0:08:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setidaknya untuk sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.51,0:08:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika kuputuskan sekarang,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.11,0:08:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bisa-bisa aku jadi musuh seluruh manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku boleh tinggal di sini sebentar, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, boleh saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:41.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:43.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Izyz...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.91,0:08:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya dia tak bohong,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi ada hal penting yang masih\Ndia sembunyikan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.98,0:08:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Artinya, paling aman membiarkannya\Ntetap bersamaku sembari waspada.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, kita adakan pesta penyambutan Izyz!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, Pak Kades!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.90,0:09:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:17.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.50,0:09:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.11,0:09:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah puluhan ribu kali aku melihat\Nraut wajah Goblin menjelang ajal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.84,0:09:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal umur tiga hari saja belum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.65,0:09:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak sakit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.43,0:09:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu karena dia berbakat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada Goblin yang luar biasa berbakat,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi umurnya luar biasa pendek.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:46.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masamune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.45,0:10:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bukan karena luka,\Ntapi umurnya yang habis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.79,0:10:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Great Heal takkan berpengaruh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pak Kades, aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}menciptakan resep baru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin semua penduduk desa\Nbisa membuatnya dengan gembira.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:18.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau hebat, Masamune.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:20.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini gyoza.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.81,0:10:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waktu melihat Pak Kades dan Karen,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}resep itu muncul di kepalaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.78,0:10:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang tertawa bersama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.94,0:10:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Membuat dan menyantapnya bersama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah resep yang ingin aku ciptakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.11,0:10:36.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau memang berbakat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang pasti akan mengingatmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.33,0:10:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pak Kades juga?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:44.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.41,0:10:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita adakan pesta untuk mengenang Masamune!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.35,0:10:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan kau mau memakannya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.77,0:11:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.77,0:11:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba perhatikan skill itu lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa maksudmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.31,0:11:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:16.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masamune?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.83,0:11:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang sebenarnya terjadi...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada... apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau... Masamune, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, sepertinya begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:38.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa bisa jadi begini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entahlah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.43,0:11:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ada yang terasa berubah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin, skill-ku...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Search Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skill-nya "Masamune"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:51.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa efeknya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.65,0:11:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kurang tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya tak ada yang berubah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, keahlian biasaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}rasanya tetap bisa kulakukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.04,0:12:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hasilnya juga bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seperti yang terlihat, tak ada yang berubah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.30,0:12:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau benar-benar Masamune?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.26,0:12:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya, aku hidup kembali.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, kita adakan pesta kebangkitan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana bisa dia hidup kembali, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena dia Goblin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.57,0:12:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku punya semacam kemampuan khusus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.07,0:12:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kebetulan sekali.\NKemampuan apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.99,0:12:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada semua makhluk yang punya skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.87,0:12:46.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku kurang lebih bisa merasakan\Nkapan mereka akan mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Agar skill-nya bisa dimakan, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goblin itu takkan mati dalam waktu lama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.04,0:12:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurasa dia akan hidup puluhan kali lebih lama\Ndaripada Goblin sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:12:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mustahil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.76,0:13:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar atau tidaknya, lihat saja pekan depan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari tadi dia bicara seolah tahu alasannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di antara semua makhluk hidup,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.65,0:13:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goblin yang paling mudah beradaptasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.31,0:13:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka itu kumpulan potensi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.11,0:13:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Simon juga pernah bilang begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.45,0:13:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menurutmu lingkungan itu apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:25.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah tempat tinggal atau iklim?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.95,0:13:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lingkungan itu
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.87,0:13:31.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah "sesuatu yang tidak berubah"\Nbagi makhluk hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.96,0:13:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sesuatu yang tidak berubah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.63,0:13:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagi para Goblin,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kaulah sesuatu yang tidak berubah itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.55,0:13:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena ada kau yang terus hidup,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}para Goblin mulai beradaptasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke arah umur yang lebih panjang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.43,0:13:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, tak aneh semua itu terjadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berkatmu, umur Goblin bertambah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.27,0:13:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini belum pernah terjadi sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.53,0:14:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pak Kades, kemari!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pak Kades, cepat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Cicipi masakannya!\N- Ya, bahkan Goblin biasa pun
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah kumpulan potensi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apalagi Goblin istimewa
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang potensinya tak terduga.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.14,0:14:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau memanggilku, Pak Kades?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.35,0:14:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, ada yang mau kutanyakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, sedang apa kau?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.94,0:14:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm, kau tidak suka dipangku?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suka atau tidak, itu tidak penting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, langsung ke ranjang, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pak Kades, boleh minta waktu sebentar...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:15:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, sedang mau buat anak, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:02.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Nanti saja.\N- Bukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goblin memang luar biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka pengertian soal membuat anak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayolah, jangan menggodaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.64,0:15:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lebih dari itu, ada yang mau kutanyakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa pun pertanyaanmu,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.59,0:15:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}akan kujawab.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tahu sesuatu soal Izyz?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.86,0:15:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa bertanya padaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.49,0:15:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada dua alasan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.45,0:15:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama, kalau bertanya pada Chloe,\Ndia pasti menjawab dengan marah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:32.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia langsung mengamuk seperti sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.87,0:15:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kedua,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.33,0:15:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena kau menyebut Raja Iblis\Ndengan sebutan "orang itu".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurasa kau yang paling tahu\Ndi antara saudari-saudarimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, aku tidak setahu itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepengetahuanmu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.97,0:15:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naga itu salah satu dari Tiga Bangsawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.14,0:15:54.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penguasa Langit Hitam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.77,0:15:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iblis Surgawi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.48,0:15:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Roh Keajaiban.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:16:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah sebutan mereka bertiga.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.27,0:16:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, kenapa mereka disebut "bangsawan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.07,0:16:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sang Iblis Surgawi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.99,0:16:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}juga dikenal sebagai Adipati Iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:13.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Konon julukan itu berasal dari masa\Nsaat dia menjadi adipati di negeri manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa dia jadi adipati?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.25,0:16:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entahlah, aku tidak tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, yang menentukan Raja Iblis...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiga Bangsawan itu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.96,0:16:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa pun yang ingin menjadi Raja Iblis\Nharus mendapat persetujuan mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.05,0:16:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa aturannya begitu, aku pun tidak tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.05,0:16:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, kenapa Chloe tiba-tiba\Ningin melawannya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena naga itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}menuntun manusia untuk\Nmengalahkan Raja Iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitulah rumornya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.37,0:16:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pak Kades!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:17:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Manusia yang mondar-mandir\Ndi sekitar perbatasan makin banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya mereka sedang mencari sesuatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:08.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu pasti orang suruhan si Pangeran.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia masih mencari Izyz, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.38,0:17:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terus lakukan patroli.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.81,0:17:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau ada yang masuk ke desa,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.26,0:17:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}langsung usir tanpa ampun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, tunggu sebentar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sendiri tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.34,0:17:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.27,0:17:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kau... punya keluhan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.90,0:17:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa bersama penduduk lain dan Pak Kades...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.62,0:17:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setiap hari aku senang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.\NMaaf pertanyaanku aneh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.82,0:17:39.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hati-hati di jalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:43.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goblin itu kelihatannya kuat, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di antara Goblin yang kukenal,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.84,0:17:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mungkin dia masuk sepuluh besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.55,0:17:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanzo yang tadi sejauh ini yang paling kuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:17:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa gara-gara aku?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:17:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.89,0:18:02.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ini Goblin yang lain tidak berevolusi\Nke arah umur panjang,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.78,0:18:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}apa itu gara-gara aku, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau berpikir begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.40,0:18:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menyusun sistem dengan niat baik,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}agar mereka tak kesulitan\Nmeski berumur pendek.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin justru itu\Nyang mematikan potensi mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.37,0:18:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau hebat, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.69,0:18:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Artinya,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kau berhasil membuat semua Goblin\Nhidup bahagia, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena tak punya keluhan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.03,0:18:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mereka tak perlu berevolusi\Nuntuk beradaptasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.42,0:18:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau raja paling hebat yang pernah kukenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.93,0:18:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Evolusi adaptif untuk memperpanjang umur.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau itu bisa dipicu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}lingkungan seperti apa yang harus kubuat, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan ini, selesai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.70,0:18:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berikutnya, Hokusai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.45,0:18:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serahkan padaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tim Hokusai...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tim yang punya skill khusus\Ndi bidang melukis dan seni.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hebat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gaya gambar mereka berbeda-beda,\Ntapi semuanya mirip aslinya...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sip!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.63,0:19:18.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang bisa mengangkat barang berat,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tolong bawa ini ke gudang bawah tanah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.22,0:19:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kali ini apa yang kau rencanakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku meminta Goblin yang baru lahir\Nuntuk membuat umeshu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Umeshu biasanya bisa diminum\Nsekitar seminggu setelah direndam,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.74,0:19:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi lebih enak kalau didiamkan\Nsetengah sampai satu tahun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.45,0:19:42.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuciptakan alasan agar mereka\Ntetap ingin hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.83,0:19:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ini, demi membuat mereka\Nhidup bahagia,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku menyusun sistem lewat\Nberbagai percobaan,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.17,0:19:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi itu gagal...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:51.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.05,0:19:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}itu kembali lagi ke apa yang disebut gagal...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:56.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:19:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga mengerti.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.51,0:20:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagi manusia,\Ntujuh hari itu terlalu singkat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.85,0:20:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak akan mengulangi\Nkegagalan yang sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.27,0:20:07.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika mereka puas dengan hidup mereka,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.52,0:20:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}umur mereka tetap akan pendek.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.77,0:20:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kubuat mereka ingin terus hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan begitu, umur mereka bisa bertambah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.86,0:20:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, bukan hanya itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.82,0:20:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin menumbuhkan rasa bahagia
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.53,0:20:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}hingga mereka ingin hidup lebih lama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau memang hebat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.54,0:20:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan, mungkin lebih tepatnya,\Nhebat seperti biasanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau ada yang bisa kubantu,\Nakan kubantu apa saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.54,0:20:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mia, mau ke mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia kenapa, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.85,0:20:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa, sih? Kenapa, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.19,0:20:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Goblin yang namanya Akira itu,\Nkapan matinya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:06.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.93,0:22:09.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}semuanya langsung pergi...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.64,0:22:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eunomia.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.23,0:22:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.15,0:22:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Apa lihat-lihat?\NBukan urusanmu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.03,0:22:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, Eirene dan Dike jadi khawatir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.07,0:22:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada masalah apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.41,0:22:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau mencari muka di depan Kak Dike, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.70,0:22:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.26,0:22:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih seperti biasanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.83,0:22:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, kau ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.67,0:22:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau mau hidup sampai kapan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.61,0:22:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal hanya Goblin biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.96,0:22:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jahat sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.17,0:22:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.38,0:22:44.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masamune berevolusi\Ndan umurnya bertambah panjang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.34,0:22:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Artinya, skill "Umur Manusia 80 Tahun"\Njuga bisa bertambah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.35,0:22:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pengaruhnya mungkin berubah,\Ndan efeknya bisa lebih panjang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.56,0:22:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk sekarang...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.02,0:23:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lebih lama dari semuanya...\Nlebih lama daripada kau...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.07,0:23:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku ingin hidup lebih lama.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan apa-apa!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.30,0:23:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa, sih? Kenapa, sih?
